{"kind":"assert","text":"Retirement act for the cutover window of plan 036. This act amends\nthe inventory b6f9f350.\n\nThe window puts dap-lending, dap-grow and dap-demo on main with a\nnew register each. Each scope of these three Workers is in the old\nformat, and it retires when its Worker is deployed. The reader\ncommit is 64112e4576b4c3c8fb668389786deb6b703da417.\n\nLast entries, read at 00:48 EST on 14 November with the command\nline at 64112e45. Each read is signed and writes nothing.\n\ndap-lending, 8 scopes, 1 room:\n- register sc_c67lq575p5nfkfiwwbr7buodsv6t44i4u6ptcuuhmpcgcduljd7q,\n  entry 3 of 2026-10-14.\n- directory sc_sgj2favzltftgb47n6f5nclmed734ifdbjq74zxpfpvyiz4rj4kq,\n  entry 6 of 2026-10-14. No archive.\n\ndap-grow, 11 scopes, 1 room:\n- register sc_yatkl7kuktl2gauvjrt7b2zy7nr6nu55vkzorot2bm5n2umgpbnq,\n  entry 3 of 2026-10-20.\n- directory sc_ryghgistvpshbaznxlbleop5zqruy2kmogy4jeigr7j3yqlewceq,\n  entry 13 of 2026-10-22, `bind-archive`. The one archive binding.\n  I did not verify the archive.\n\ndap-demo, 122 scopes, 14 rooms, 2 registers:\n- register sc_b5q435os6lggypatelcltqzvul4kqxzdaaxpmybvwumsmxwj2djq\n  (Register 17, `open`), entry 39 of 2026-11-02, 13 foundings.\n- register sc_zm56yco5zyx7n3kx7e5jcxz55q5wp7y2lcuy2ialj7r7mzzcarjq\n  (Register 26), entry 3 of 2026-11-07, with its one room\n  sc_degepxtn6oxtmemzd45wxpkdrem7bpnon6xexlzevnfipy4rafhq.\n- Six directories that a home of ours reads. The newest entry is\n  entry 25 of 2026-11-06 in the J5 Site room\n  sc_bh3sl22s2ocblab35gwg455r62paadizns6uwkembbpuwnqzkpya.\n- Seven rooms that no home of ours reads: two of `@j4-builder` and\n  five of `@owner`, founded from 2026-10-30 to 2026-11-01. The\n  evidence directories of our own runs name each of them.\nNo register or directory of the three Workers has an entry after\n2026-11-07. The inventory of 13 November found no scope with an\nentry after 2026-11-10.\n\nOutside this window, and not retired by it:\n- artroom-scope keeps version cf086a04 of 64112e45 with its 9\n  scopes. Hugh decides whether the Worker is deleted.\n- dap-connect keeps version 07e2ec68 of 7135dc39 with the O4 room.\n  It gets its own window.\n\nEach line with its hash is in\n~/play/artroom-evidence/2026-11-14-cutover-deployment-prep, files\n`room-inventory.md` and `refresh-last-entry-0048.tsv`.\n\nTo read a retired room: check out the reader commit and run\n`artroom-replay` on a clone of the room's repository. The journal of\na retired room stays in the storage of its Worker, and no deployed\ncode reads it. A rollback of the Worker to its old version reads it\nagain, and strands each room that the new version made.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}